t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动计划训练超5万亿参数大模型，规模或将刷新国内纪录</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI首款AI硬件细节曝光：甜甜圈造型、售价300至400美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI与Adobe深化合作，ChatGPT正式接入70多款Adobe创意工具</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里通义千问升级Qwen3.8-MAX，上线办公助理与定时任务功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b6dece8615fc06bfcee60eb8999fdae0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里通义千问大模型正式上线“思考研究”、“定时任务”及“办公助理”核心能力，并全面支持旗舰模型Qwen3.8-MAX。此次升级标志着大模型从辅助对话向自主执行转型。其中，“思考研究”模式强化了复杂推理与信息整合能力，可自动生成结构化汇报文档；“办公助理”具备连接外部应用与操作系统能力，支持打通备忘录、日历、邮件，并能自主操作浏览器完成多步骤任务，直接交付Office文档，实现跨端协同。此外，“定时任务”功能支持自动化处理周期性工作，如行业简报梳理与邮件分类。该系列更新旨在解决职场复杂决策与重复性工作痛点，通过提升AI自主执行力，推动人工智能在企业办公场景的深度落地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布离线翻译设备Gemma Translator，搭载51亿参数模型实现本地化翻译</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c98465b9990f07b5c8d75ae0e9f5b496.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌Creative Lab团队于8月6日推出离线翻译设备Gemma Translator，该设备基于树莓派Raspberry Pi 5开发，通过本地化部署实现跨语种实时对话。核心模型采用谷歌Gemma 4E2B，总参数量51亿，激活参数量23亿，专为资源受限的边缘设备优化。系统通过LiteRT-LM框架执行翻译推理，并集成Moonshine模型处理语音转写与合成，全程无需联网即可完成从语音输入到译文播报及文本显示的全流程。此举为端侧模型提供了明确的产品化路径，展示了将大模型封装为独立成品、实现插电即用的技术可行性，有效解决了对云端网络的依赖，为边缘计算场景下的实时翻译应用提供了成熟的硬件参考方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动计划训练超5万亿参数大模型，规模或将刷新国内纪录</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d920e5095af766f1e5bde33cf9dac4e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动正处于讨论阶段，计划训练一个参数量超过5万亿的大模型，若落地将成为国内已知规模最大的模型。该模型被视为对标GPT-5.6或Opus 5级别的性能水准。在算力需求方面，以H100显卡为基准，训练该规模模型需百万张显卡运行35天，或10万张显卡运行347天。考虑到算力储备与工程效率，字节跳动可能采取20至30万张显卡进行3至4个月的训练，整体研发周期预计在半年至一年。此举旨在显著提升豆包大模型的逻辑推理与综合智商，使其达到国际顶尖水平。目前该计划尚处于早期阶段，最终是否发布及商业化回报仍存在不确定性。此举标志着国产大模型参数规模正从万亿级别向更高量级迈进，对算力基础设施提出了极高要求。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI首款AI硬件细节曝光：甜甜圈造型、售价300至400美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/52d3f21132ebb785afc1bf5c7019f1ff.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI首款自研AI硬件细节曝光，该产品由OpenAI与前苹果设计师Jony Ive合作开发，预计于2027年发布。设备外形呈“甜甜圈”造型，体积约为冰球大小（直径约7.62厘米），售价预估在300至400美元之间。该设备定位为无显示屏的家庭智能音箱，支持单手携带。硬件配置包含可移动部件、灯光、摄像头及多种传感器，旨在通过物理反馈提示交互状态。交互核心基于更先进的语音模型，机制类似于手机端ChatGPT的语音模式，旨在实现更自然的类人对话。此次产品发布标志着OpenAI正式将对话AI能力从软件层面延伸至硬件载体，通过与Jony Ive的工业设计合作，试图在竞争激烈的AI硬件市场中构建差异化体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与Adobe深化合作，ChatGPT正式接入70多款Adobe创意工具</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b947ac5e91223bb3eb606c2aa8ca4bc1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Adobe与OpenAI合作大幅扩容，自8月6日起，用户可在ChatGPT中直接调用Photoshop、Premiere、Acrobat、Lightroom、Illustrator及InDesign等70多款Adobe工具。用户通过在ChatGPT插件页面添加Adobe插件，输入“@Adobe”及具体指令，即可完成照片编辑、视频制作及PDF生成等任务。该插件支持与OpenAI的Codex及Work套件协同，用户登录Creative Cloud账户后可同步云端文件并调用Adobe Firefly生成式AI模型。Adobe副总裁Forrest Key表示，此举旨在将专业创意工具嵌入AI原生工作流，但强调插件并非旗舰应用的替代品，复杂创作仍需依赖旗舰软件。此次集成标志着ChatGPT正向“超级工作台”演进，通过消除软</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
